</addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MINATO KIYOTAKA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAMAOKI KEIKO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAMAOKI SATOSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MINATO, KIYOTAKA</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAMAOKI, KEIKO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAMAOKI, SATOSHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A lighting device (10), comprising a light emitting part (11) formed of light emitting elements, a flexible shaft (12) which supports the light emitting part on the tip side and is freely flexible, a telescoping part (13) which supports the base end side of the flexible shaft, can store the flexible shaft, and consists of parts that nest for storage, a drive part (14) which drives the light emitting part, a power supply part (15) which supplies power to the drive part, and a case (16) which stores at least the drive part, wherein it further comprises a spring mechanism capable of telescoping the telescoping part and the flexible shaft and, as the flexible shaft is extended by the spring mechanism, the nestably telescoping part is extended.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention porte sur un générateur d'éclairs comportant une section (11) d'émission de lumière composée d'émetteurs de lumière, une tige librement flexible (12) dont l'extrémité porte lesdits émetteurs, une section télescopique abritant la base de la tige flexible et pouvant recevoir la tige entière, et constituée de parties pouvant s'emboîter l'une dans l'autre à des fins de rangement, la commande (14) de la section d'émission de lumière, l'alimentation (15) de ladite commande, et un boîtier abritant au moins la commande et comportant de plus un mécanisme à ressort actionnant la section télescopique et la tige flexible de manière à ce que la tige étant déployée par le ressort, la partie télescopique le soit également.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>